(7622353, 1234026, 3306, '<td valign="top">A retro feel to this makes it interesting. The consistency in the bottles is nicely contrasted by the inconsistency of the glasses.</td>', 'A retro feel to this makes it interesting. The consistency in the bottles is nicely contrasted by the inconsistency of the glasses.', '2019-03-28 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
