(7622359, 1234603, 3306, '<td valign="top">The asymmetry of the picture is interesting. Lots to look at. Besides the cats, the foot catches my eye. It adds humor. The cat and the flower pot on the back shelf have a light band around the top. Was that a result of processing?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-03-29 01:05:53.</i></td>', 'The asymmetry of the picture is interesting. Lots to look at. Besides the cats, the foot catches my eye. It adds humor. The cat and the flower pot on the back shelf have a light band around the top. Was that a result of processing?', '2019-03-28 20:24:35.000000', '2019-03-29 01:05:53.000000', 1),
(7622360, 1234643, 114285, '<td valign="top">Just admiring all your books and knickknacks and photographs, and of course who could not admire the fierce look of your new little pooch, his legs spread apart, he is the star!  Not sure with what went wrong with what looks like the swirly green wallpaper in the background. Did you use the liquify tool to do that? Already voted.</td>', 'Just admiring all your books and knickknacks and photographs, and of course who could not admire the fierce look of your new little pooch, his legs spread apart, he is the star!  Not sure with what went wrong with what looks like the swirly green wallpaper in the background. Did you use the liquify tool to do that? Already voted.', '2019-03-28 20:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
